+Milestone 1.2 exits are verified: complete R-008 categories/validation, R-011 truthful runnable docs, R-012 nonempty product checks and R-013 isolated source module execution, with retained 1.1 behavior and input preservation. This report/result/evidence and initial T-008 checkbox accompany the eligible milestone parent status in one task commit. Publication precedes issue #9 closure; native milestone #2 closes only after its four task issues, report and exits are verified. Phase review T-009 starts after that closure/readback.
